          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let S = subject, O = object, V = verb",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "Then, the average Okinawan sentence template is: [time] [Sぬ or O] V.",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
          "text": "ぬ = 's in this context. So it can be part of the sentence itself or possession.",
